Comment: 9,0:23:29.30,0:23:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Jonathan Buczek
Dialogue: 9,0:00:00.56,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So Jolyne got punished on purpose
Dialogue: 9,0:00:04.53,0:00:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so she could be locked up\Nin the ultra-high-security ward and find the bone!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:07.49,0:00:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:08.95,0:00:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I successfully protect her\Nto the very end, I'll marry her.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:13.83,0:00:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my conditions.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.91,0:00:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:17.75,0:00:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver Down!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us your blessing.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.76,0:00:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The electric potential\Nof nervous system signals
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.73,0:00:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,is very small, about 70 millivolts.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This Stand feeds\Non these small pulses of energy.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.11,0:00:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Survivor's attacks\Nare undetectable and painless.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All it does is awaken\Nits victim's anger.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:39.89,0:02:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:43.60,0:02:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,From here, I can see
Dialogue: 9,0:02:45.65,0:02:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the strongest parts\Nof every fighter's body!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:50.69,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Fight Club!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fight!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:05.04,0:03:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always pissed me off, you bastards!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:12.17,0:03:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The enemy Stand user must be among them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:17.39,0:03:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One of them manipulated the guards\Ninto fighting each other.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:22.14,0:03:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bone is somewhere in the ultra-high-security ward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll do whatever it takes to get it back!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:29.11,0:03:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let anyone\Nstand in my way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:32.11,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If anyone dares, I'll kill...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:36.07,0:03:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait... kill?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:38.62,0:03:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I really just think that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:41.33,0:03:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This burning sensation\Nawakening inside me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:44.58,0:03:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this my fighting spirit?\NIt's driving me to conquer everything,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:47.71,0:03:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no matter who my opponent is\Nor what happens to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:51.05,0:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why do I feel so aggressive?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:57.59,0:03:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This prison guard...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:59.59,0:04:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He wants to do to me\Nwhat he did to the other guard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:04.48,0:04:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it'll be fine. He's no match\Nfor my Stone Free.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:22.78,0:04:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:37.30,0:04:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it, FE40536.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your strong point.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:43.10,0:04:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those strings coming out\Nof your muscles.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:48.19,0:04:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's magnificent.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:49.98,0:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's your greatest power.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:54.32,0:04:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What he just did...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:04:56.03,0:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even though his brawl with the other guard\Nwas strangely brutal,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:00.99,0:05:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it was still just a brawl.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But now,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:05.28,0:05:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}his movements aren't even human!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.75,0:05:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to beat him quickly\Nand with everything I've got!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:20.84,0:05:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The guard's muscles...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:23.18,0:05:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're sparkling brightly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:25.76,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The way he's been chaining\Nhis movements...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:29.68,0:05:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How can a human ignore\Nfear and pain{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:32.94,0:05:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and exert such force\Nwhile attacking and jumping?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.07,0:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if those beautiful lights\Nemanating from his muscles{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}point out his strongest parts,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}then that leg...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.08,0:05:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the leg I attacked.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.50,0:05:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My attack worked!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:51.96,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My attack seriously\Ndamaged his leg!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:59.34,0:06:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you\Nyou could walk in front of me?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:02.26,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting on my nerves!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:03.97,0:06:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The others have started fighting too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:13.06,0:06:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:14.65,0:06:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to immobilize him fast\Nand focus on the bone!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:30.41,0:06:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky you\Ndidn't twist your neck
Dialogue: 9,0:06:32.50,0:06:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,flailing your punches around.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:45.80,0:06:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To bed, now!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:00.11,0:07:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What happened?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:02.24,0:07:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How did he attack me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That bastard!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.99,0:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:12.75,0:07:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a Stand user too.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.38,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than one Stand user in the ultra-high-security ward.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:19.25,0:07:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He already had a Stand on a disc!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:23.18,0:07:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what did he do, and how?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:27.76,0:07:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't give him\Nany chance to counter me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:31.10,0:07:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I didn't see his Stand,\Nso how did he attack me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The wound is deep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:37.44,0:07:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Very deep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:39.40,0:07:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A razor blade or a knife\Nwouldn't cause such a wound.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:44.37,0:07:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did he do to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:49.45,0:07:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he has a very powerful Stand,\NI should be able to see it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,FE40536.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:56.75,0:07:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You attack with strings.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:58.50,0:08:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see strings\Nand a whole bundle of them in your body.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:03.34,0:08:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your greatest strength comes from this power.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:07.43,0:08:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what makes you strong.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:10.51,0:08:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:14.43,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you shining.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:19.94,0:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when did you become\Na Stand user?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.57,0:08:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Or just now?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:36.79,0:08:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I saw it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:39.87,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I saw his Stand!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:41.17,0:08:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His Stand took form!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:47.59,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A Stand user...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:49.26,0:08:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That bastard is the assassin\Nsent to take me out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:57.27,0:09:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These strings don't need\Nany strength to protect me.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:00.23,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can easily change\Nthe trajectory of a punch
Dialogue: 9,0:09:05.11,0:09:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,by deflecting it slightly.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right into my trap.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:11.24,0:09:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You used both your arms,\Nso I can restrict all your movements.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:16.74,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cover you with my vest.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.55,0:09:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:34.35,0:09:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get back up.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:49.40,0:09:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's happening again!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:51.45,0:09:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is his Stand doing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.62,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't see it!\NWhat did he do to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:59.33,0:10:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.91,0:10:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:05.42,0:10:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a fool of me.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:11.09,0:10:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoners are the scum of society.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:13.47,0:10:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate it when garbage like you\Ntreats me like shit.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:18.64,0:10:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been a single day on duty\Nwhere this didn't piss me off.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare look down on me?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:23.94,0:10:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for it.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hold back anymore!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:27.95,0:10:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to let out all my anger.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:29.53,0:10:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hold back anymore!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:31.49,0:10:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to pay for this.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:34.41,0:10:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:35.74,0:10:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going crazy,\Nand you're going to pay the price!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:46.75,0:10:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that, on the ceiling?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:48.46,0:10:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, his Stand is...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:52.72,0:10:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'm going to...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:54.01,0:10:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get out of here!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.56,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,His attack is coming straight at me!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:02.02,0:11:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:03.52,0:11:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no way out.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:10.19,0:11:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget\NI'm a prison guard?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:13.49,0:11:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I restrain prisoners\Nalmost every day.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:17.41,0:11:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your right hand may look free,
Dialogue: 9,0:11:20.12,0:11:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but this tie does more\Nthan strangle you.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:25.04,0:11:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also twisting the joint\Nof your left shoulder
Dialogue: 9,0:11:29.46,0:11:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so your right arm goes numb\Nand you can't raise it.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:33.55,0:11:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your right hand can't\Nreach my face.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:38.09,0:11:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This tie has a weakness\NI know very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:45.06,0:11:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your right hand could grab my balls.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:49.57,0:11:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't have bothered me\Nunder other circumstances.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can counter that too!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:01.70,0:12:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't do anything,\Nhis Stand's true form will...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.33,0:12:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The glass ceiling...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:11.84,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Those holes in the ceiling!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:15.17,0:12:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to break free!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.39,0:12:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I ruptured his eardrum!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:21.27,0:12:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,His grip loosened!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.81,0:12:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The universe is filled\Nwith countless rocks and space debris.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:29.19,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Many of these rocks are pulled in\Nby Earth's gravitational force.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:34.27,0:12:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Most of them disintegrate\Nbefore reaching the surface,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:38.28,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}what would happen{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:39.45,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}if meteorites entered\Nthe atmosphere{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}keeping optimal speed\Nand angle?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming too.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:26.87,0:13:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this alone.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.96,0:13:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who decides here.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:32.96,0:13:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, I asked for your help,\Nbut I want to be perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.72,0:13:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, if Whitesnake is truly\Ndetermined to eliminate Jolyne,
Dialogue: 9,0:13:45.89,0:13:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he must have sent\Ntwo assassins, maybe more.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:51.64,0:13:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be at least three Stand users\Nwho want to kill Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:55.15,0:14:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet back here\Nonce we've taken care of them.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.49,0:14:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.45,0:14:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:05.16,0:14:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back\Nbefore the guard wakes up.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:11.00,0:14:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And we already agreed\Nthat I'm going to marry Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:15.13,0:14:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget it.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:22.35,0:14:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?\NI don't understand you.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.54,0:14:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meteorites!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His attacks are meteorites{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:53.75,0:14:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that are being drawn in\Nby this prison guard!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:57.25,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what was hitting me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:59.92,0:15:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His Stand draws in\Nmeteorites from space.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:04.01,0:15:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But they disintegrate\Nbefore touching him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.60,0:15:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And another one is going to fall.\NHe's going to draw in another one!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before that happens...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:15.77,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:17.23,0:15:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I won't let you go!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.49,0:15:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the winner and I'll shine.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:23.99,0:15:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.21,0:15:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to tear the skin off you\Nfrom head to toe!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:41.17,0:15:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, you damn guard!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:52.51,0:15:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He let me go!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:08.49,0:16:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had a hard time dodging them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.62,0:16:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I tried to deflect\Nthe meteorites toward him,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it's just like last time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.29,0:16:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not a single meteorite touches him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:21.38,0:16:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They disintegrate\Nright before hitting him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:26.51,0:16:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This prison guard's ability{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:28.72,0:16:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}lets him draw in\Nthe meteorites falling from the sky!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.69,0:16:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But no matter what I do,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.06,0:16:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the meteorites only hit me\Nwhen I get close to him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:42.49,0:16:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:44.82,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning rocks are falling\Nfrom the sky onto me.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:48.95,0:16:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they meteorites?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.45,0:16:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be my greatest power?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:55.41,0:16:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,FE40536.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:57.96,0:16:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How many meteorites have you taken?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:00.13,0:17:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You look pretty damn banged up.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.04,0:17:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They hit your arms,\Nyour left side and your right leg.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.01,0:17:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes five times.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:09.68,0:17:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Or six?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:11.26,0:17:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The next one will be fatal.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:25.32,0:17:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bluffing.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.78,0:17:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can barely stand.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:32.41,0:17:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just trying to fool me\Nby standing like that.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:35.87,0:17:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is, your arms can't\Nfight me anymore.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.13,0:17:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arm muscles have gone all dark.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:47.88,0:17:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They've really lost their shine.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:51.72,0:17:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we have some fun?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.10,0:17:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how weak you've become.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.98,0:18:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.07,0:18:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hit me.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:08.03,0:18:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't even counter.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:11.28,0:18:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:12.99,0:18:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to hit me?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:15.41,0:18:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can even close my eyes if you want.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:25.71,0:18:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Over there!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:27.38,0:18:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That thing on the ground.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:29.30,0:18:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the bone Whitesnake wants!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:32.26,0:18:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the bone! It's right there!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:36.68,0:18:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even fight anymore!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:41.60,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're using the wall\Nto block the meteorites.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:45.69,0:18:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd play it like that!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:51.23,0:18:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteorites were already crashing down on me
Dialogue: 9,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,from the other side of the wall!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:04.04,0:19:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it, you're so banged up\Nyou can't counter my punches anymore!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:11.00,0:19:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,One stared at the wall
Dialogue: 9,0:19:14.30,0:19:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The other watched the stars\NFrom beyond the bars
Dialogue: 9,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of the two am I?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:22.81,0:19:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And take this!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:27.94,0:19:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bone is right there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:30.90,0:19:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll do anything\Nto get closer to Whitesnake.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:35.15,0:19:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll even drink stagnant water.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.16,0:19:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll even become the strongest!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.29,0:19:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:45.75,0:19:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape the meteorite anymore!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:51.38,0:19:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course I want to watch the stars.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:54.63,0:19:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to keep watching them\Nuntil I see Papa again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:00.85,0:20:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.64,0:20:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your finishing blow!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:05.23,0:20:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:08.40,0:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't dodge this deadly blow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.15,0:20:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't stop it\Nwith Stone Free anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.95,0:20:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm superior!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:20.45,0:20:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:22.41,0:20:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I did manage to get your right shoe.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.59,0:20:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She even put a brick inside it!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:37.22,0:20:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The meteorite struck it,\Nbut the blow wasn't as violent.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:42.26,0:20:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It changed trajectory!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:48.56,0:20:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The meteorite is going to disintegrate.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:50.86,0:20:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way it can touch you.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:53.61,0:20:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm only talking about the meteorite.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My shoe!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.16,0:21:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:10.62,0:21:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:13.17,0:21:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:20.63,0:21:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's with this bitch?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:25.60,0:21:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She never gives up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:28.06,0:21:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She really won't let anything go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:30.94,0:21:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:33.15,0:21:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, if the meteorite hits\Nsomething else first,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:36.82,0:21:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she can hit me with it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:39.32,0:21:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's disgusting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How dare she do\Nsuch a horrible thing to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:45.58,0:21:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This woman...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:49.75,0:21:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I choose to watch the stars.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:59.17,0:22:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
